<title>SPAIN: Spain Seat to keep plant open in August this year.</title>
<headline>Spain Seat to keep plant open in August this year.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volkswagen AG's Spanish unit Seat VOWG.F told Reuters on Thursday it would keep its factory open this year in August, making 27,000 cars in a month it usually closes down for summer holidays.</p>
<p>&quot;This is the first time in our history we are not closing for August,&quot; a Seat spokesman told Reuters. &quot;With this measure we will make an additional 27,000 cars this year,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
